---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Costs - Thamara Kandabada";
const slashpageImage = "/featured-images/costs.png";
---
<PageLayout title={pageTitle} image={slashpageImage}>
  <h1>Costs</h1>
  <p>These are the costs associated with maintaining this website. I have converted all costs to GBP (£) for consistency. They are rounded up to the nearest pound.</p>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 06 Sep 2026</p>

<h2>Preface</h2>
  <p>This is a document of the costs I'm currently incurring, rather than one of what it <em>could</em> cost—hence the inclusion of all the redirected domain names. Ideally, if you're thinking of running a small personal website using the same setup (Astro, GitHub, Vercel), your costs will be much lower with a single domain name.</p>
  <p>I have not included any hardware costs since I haven't purchased any dedicated hardware specifically to run this website.</p>
<h2>Monthly costs</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th scope="col">Item</th>
      <th scope="col">Service</th>
      <th scope="col">Cost</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>Web hosting (static site deployment)</td>
      <td>Vercel (free tier)</td>
      <td>£0</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Code hosting</td>
      <td>GitHub (free tier)</td>
      <td>£0</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Comments hosting for Discuss</td>
      <td>Digital Ocean Droplet</td>
      <td>£3</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
  <tfoot>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="2"><strong>Total monthly costs</strong></td>
      <td>£3</td>
    </tr>
  </tfoot>
</table>

<h2>Annual costs</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th scope="col" colspan="2">Item</th>
      <th scope="col">Service</th>
      <th scope="col">Cost</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
    <td rowspan="10">Domain names</td>
    <td>thamara.co.uk (main)</td>
    <td rowspan="10">Porkbun</td>
    <td>£5</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>thamara.uk (redirect)</td>
    <td>£5</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>thamara.blog (redirect)</td>
    <td>£12</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>thamara.xyz (redirect)</td>
    <td>£11</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>thamarakandabada.com (redirect)</td>
    <td>£9</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>thamara.work (redirect)</td>
    <td>£8</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>thamara.contact (redirect)</td>
    <td>£9</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>thamara.cv (redirect)</td>
    <td>£6</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>windingroad.studio (redirect)</td>
    <td>£24</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>thebadtake.com (redirect)</td>
    <td>£9</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2">DNS</td>
    <td>Porkbun (free)</td>
    <td>£0</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2">SSL certificate</td>
    <td>Porkbun (free)</td>
    <td>£0</td>
  </tr>
</tbody>
<tfoot>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="3"><strong>Total annual costs</strong></td>
    <td>£98</td>
  </tr>
</tfoot>
</table>

<h2>Total cost per year</h2>
<p>Taking all these expenses into account, the total cost for running this website is <strong>approximately £134 per year</strong>.</p>

